Package: com.cfluid.cardash.diagnostics
Name: CarDash CarPlay Diagnostics
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Development
Depends: firmware (>= 16.6), firmware (<< 16.7), uikittools
Maintainer: cfluid
Author: cfluid
Description: Standalone, user-triggered CarPlay startup diagnostics for iPhone 8 Plus on iOS 16.6/Dopamine rootless. Collects one shareable log. Does not replace CarDash or implement a full authenticated receiver.
Homepage: https://github.com/cfluid101/cardash-beta
